  message: "Ordered AFTER WI-punod (2026-10-25): this fix feeds crashed-linker records into the skipped-pass map that prerequisite_absent_clauses reads through a one-value proxy (pass_silence.py:709-711) which maps every value except no_candidate_files to 'toolchain'. Land WI-punod's exported value->state mapping first, or have this fix admit only pass_crashed records. Both items correct the same docstring (pass_silence.py:683-690, :696-697)."  # 58cf
